            "title": "Sitaldas Tirathdas Judicial Test",
            "body": "The Supreme Court in CIT v. Sitaldas Tirathdas laid down that if income is diverted before reaching the assessee by an overriding title, it is diversion; if obligation arises after receipt, it is application.",
